spec: S02-04, S02-05, S02-07

Names are the filename stem verbatim — Unicode, spaces, case — and nested paths contribute only
the stem; a verbatim Name resolves as DOC.

```console
$ annotary -p rowan push "Übersicht 2026.md"
Übersicht 2026	[..]	v1

$ annotary -p rowan push docs/nested/plan-nested.md
plan-nested	[..]	v1

$ annotary -p rowan push "MiXed Case.md"
MiXed Case	[..]	v1

$ annotary -p rowan show "Übersicht 2026"
Übersicht 2026	[..]	notes	v1 by @rowan [..]	action:-	open:0	actions:approve,send-back

$ annotary -p rowan status "mixed case"
? 2
error: no Document "mixed case" — DOC is an id, a Name unique in the Vault, or the path to a pulled .md; `annotary list` shows Documents

$ annotary -p rowan status docs/nested/plan-nested.md
plan-nested	[..]	v1	action:-	open:0	mentions-me:0	seq:[..]

```
